==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dot Hero]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

